                "title": "Windsor Crystal Knob with Neos Rose",
                "description": "The Windsor Crystal Knob with Neos Rose has a wonderful, modern appearance that makes it a timeless way to bring the traditional into the contemporary. The Rectangular Crystal Windsor Knob with matching Neos Rose is available in several beautiful finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Windsor Knob and Neos Rose will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. \r\n",
